Background Investigation Process

Overview
This presentation outlines the standard procedures for conducting background investigations.

Investigation Types
- Employment Verification
- Education Verification
- Criminal History Check
- Reference Check
- Credit History (if applicable)

Process Flow
1. Initial Application Review
2. Consent Form Signed
3. Information Gathering
4. Verification Process
5. Report Generation
6. Final Review

Timeline Standards
- Standard Check: 3-5 business days
- Comprehensive Check: 7-10 business days
- International Check: 14-21 business days

Compliance Requirements
- FCPA Guidelines
- State Regulations
- EEOC Compliance
- Data Privacy Laws

Quality Assurance
- Dual verification process
- Regular audit procedures
- Continuous improvement

